gnome-sign (1.0.4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix deleting stamp templates (missing application method); the active
    template falls back to a remaining one and the last template is kept.
  * Remove duplicated search-result population.
  * Add missing translations (stamp editor, printing) in es, en and pt.
  * Single locked dependency source (pyproject.toml, requirements.lock)
    shared by Debian, Snap and Flatpak packaging.

 -- GNOME-Sign Maintainers <packages@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 06 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000

gnome-sign (1.0.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Security: disable automatic network fetching while validating signatures
    of opened PDFs.
  * Security: install Python dependencies with pinned versions and hashes.
  * Validate signatures against the system trust store and with full
    modification-detection analysis.
  * Fix signature page detection for nested PDF page trees.
  * Escape signature stamp markup and avoid overwriting existing signed files.
  * Fix duplicate/typo translation strings and unify the default language.

 -- GNOME-Sign Maintainers <packages@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 06 Oct 2026 08:30:00 +0000

